Package: ros-store
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, ros-agent (= @VERSION@), polkitd, pkexec
Recommends: ros-branding
Maintainer: ROS Project <yvesm189@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/yvesm189/ros
Description: Isoko, the ROS Store
 Browses the application catalogue published by a ROS management console and
 installs from it.
 .
 The store runs as the person using the machine and never as root: it shells
 out to ros-agent through pkexec, and the agent accepts only a catalogue slug,
 so the authorisation cannot be turned into installing an arbitrary package.
